   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Sentinel-2 passes over the same\n  field every 5 days.\n- The picture is made of pixels.\n  One pixel = 10 m x 10 m of land.\n- For each pixel it measures 10 bands\n  (colours), including Red and NIR.",
