   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- The land is cut into 2 km blocks.\n  Train on some, test on the others.\n- Also test on another region and\n  on another year.\n\nWhy? Neighbour pixels look alike, so\nmixing them would give a fake high score.",
   "originalText": "- The land is cut into 2 km blocks.\n  Train on some, test on the others.\n- Also test on another region and\n  on another year.\n\nWhy? Neighbour pixels look alike, so\nmixing them would give a fake high score.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
